  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support enhancement of the fishery-based livelihoods in Gaza</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of the project is to support the fishery sector in the GS aiming at
improved income, sector growth, and enhanced livelihood of fishers and their families.
The proposed intervention aims at supporting the fishery sector by enabling the repair,
operation, and maintenance of fishing boats. The major sectorial stakeholders will be
directly involved in the different stages of the implementation of the project.
The project is expected to contribute to the strengthening of livelihoods, supporting
community-driven development and fishery sector growth. At the same time this
intervention is expected to contribute to maintaining and consolidating the cessation of
hostilities after the May 2021 escalation.</narrative>
  </description>
